{'symbol': 'ALL', 'date': '2022-01-04 12:02:00', 'title': 'ALLSTATE TO DISCUSS FOURTH QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS WITH INVESTORS', 'text': "NORTHBROOK, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE ALLSTATE CORPORATION (NYSE: ALL) WILL CONDUCT A CONFERENCE CALL AND WEBCAST AT 9 A.M. EASTERN ON THURSDAY, FEB. 3, 2022, TO DISCUSS FOURTH QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS. THE COMPANY PLANS TO FILE A CURRENT REPORT ON FORM 8-K WITH THE SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION ANNOUNCING QUARTERLY RESULTS AT OR AFTER 4:15 P.M. EASTERN ON WEDNESDAY, FEB. 2. TO VIEW ALLSTATE'S QUARTERLY RESULTS AFTER THEIR FILING, INCLUDING THE EARNINGS RELEASE AND INVESTOR SUPPLEMENT, VISIT"}